01:06:47.240 --> 01:06:52.120
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: Good morning, Mr. Chair, Senate President, Ma'am.

asr-001137
01:06:53.000 --> 01:06:53.880
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: Magandang umaga po.

asr-001138
01:06:54.440 --> 01:06:56.960
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: For the Pasig-Marikina River Channel Improvement Project,

asr-001139
01:06:57.100 --> 01:07:04.360
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: this is the last Pasig-Marikina stages out of the five packages that we had actually proposed

asr-001140
01:07:04.360 --> 01:07:08.220
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: for undertaking within Metro Manila area,

asr-001141
01:07:08.580 --> 01:07:13.220
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: covering the river from Pasig River all the way to Pasig.

asr-001142
01:07:13.360 --> 01:07:14.760
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: That's the Marikina River.

asr-001143
01:07:14.760 --> 01:07:20.240
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: The projects here embodied the constructions of about six kilometers,

asr-001144
01:07:20.560 --> 01:07:24.600
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: closing the gap of the river channel improvement works downstream of Rosario

asr-001145
01:07:24.600 --> 01:07:26.240
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: all the way to Santo Nino,

asr-001146
01:07:26.780 --> 01:07:30.020
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: including the constructions of the Marikina control gate structures

asr-001147
01:07:30.020 --> 01:07:36.780
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: that would regulate the flood water coming down from Marikina River to Pasig River down to Manila Bay.

asr-001148
01:07:36.980 --> 01:07:42.780
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: So, the constructions of these projects will be fully completed in 2030,

asr-001149
01:07:43.360 --> 01:08:13.340
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: And after these completions, there's one more lacking Phase 6, we call it Phase 6, which is the most ultimate one, that is actually the constructions of the two dams in the upper Marikina River Channel, which will now regulate the flood water of 50 million cubic meters on the top of Mount Oro, and constructions of four retarding basins, and the completions of the entire 35 kilometers channel improvement for Pasig.

asr-001150
01:08:13.360 --> 01:08:44.500
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: Marikina River Channel. And this will also complement, Mr. Chair, to add to the functionality of the Pasig-Marikina entire river basin, the upcoming detailed design works for next year of the Para?aque Spillway. The spillway will address the regulated flow of floodwater that goes through Manila to Laguna de Bay and discharge big volumes of floodwater to Manila Bay through the nine-kilometer Para?aque underground tunnel.

asr-001151
01:08:44.500 --> 01:09:10.080
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: So the projects here, for these particular projects, once this is completed, and with that Paranaque Spillway complementary, it will bring down the flood water elevations of Pasig River by half full bank capacity, and eventually will allow large volumes of flooding from the inland cities of Metro Manila, particularly Quezon City, Manila, San Juan, and part of Makatiang Mandaluyong.

asr-001152
01:09:10.080 --> 01:09:13.160
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: So with that very low elevations of flood water,

asr-001153
01:09:13.360 --> 01:09:33.080
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: Pasig River, it can absorb more flood water from the inland side, and that can deduce drastically large volumes of water in the inland, kasi karamihan po niyan, ang cost talagang ng baha, especially from Marikina sections, pag full blast ang baba niya, it will actually inundate in the downstream stretch of Pasig River.

asr-001154
01:09:33.280 --> 01:09:41.080
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: Because of the high flow of Pasig River, the water that comes from San Juan River has been actually stopped at the confluence.

asr-001155
01:09:42.040 --> 01:09:43.340
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: So nagba-backflow po siya pataas.

asr-001156
01:09:43.360 --> 01:10:10.360
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: So with this completion of this project, Mr. Chair, this can be a big relief for flooding of Metro Manila, although we are not telling na ito po ang solution, but because we are also embarking with Secretary's guidance to work also on the drainage master plan of the 17 cities for Metro Manila.

asr-001157
01:10:10.360 --> 01:10:13.340
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: Kasi yun na lang po yung nakikita natin, yung 17 cities.

asr-001158
01:10:13.360 --> 01:10:26.580
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: Na drainage master plan nila, karamihan po dito because of the rapid urbanization, maliit na lang, o kaya minsan barado, and we have to look more deeper on that, where ADB, JICA, and World Bank are also helping us to come up with this study.

asr-001159
