asr-004235
02:53:02.500 --> 02:53:07.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At any point from the planning, this is not a trick question, so just answer truthfully, ha?

asr-004236
02:53:08.040 --> 02:53:11.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi ko kayo inihuli dito, may point akong gagawin, pero hindi kayo to.

asr-004237
02:53:11.620 --> 02:53:16.680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At any time between the planning of the LLRN and even before that,

asr-004238
02:53:16.760 --> 02:53:17.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: what did the President...

asr-004239
02:53:18.800 --> 02:53:23.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pinoy and Secretary Singson called the PPP sana kung nung...

asr-004240
02:53:23.800 --> 02:53:26.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi LLRN pa tawag nila eh, C6 ba tawag nila?

asr-004241
02:53:27.680 --> 02:53:29.880
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: It's C6, about C6 projects po.

asr-004242
02:53:29.980 --> 02:53:30.880
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: Yung last term na po.

asr-004243
02:53:31.120 --> 02:53:34.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At any time, whether it was the C6 or whether it's the LLRN,

asr-004244
02:53:34.920 --> 02:53:37.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: did you apply for reclamation permit sa PRA?

asr-004245
02:53:39.460 --> 02:53:40.460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes or no lang yun?

asr-004246
02:53:40.520 --> 02:53:42.580
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And it's not a trick question, just answer truthfully.

asr-004247
02:53:42.600 --> 02:53:44.600
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: As to my recall, wala po na.

asr-004248
02:53:44.600 --> 02:53:45.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Wala, okay.

asr-004249
02:53:45.560 --> 02:53:48.540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And you're familiar with Patrick Gatan, of course, no?

asr-004250
02:53:48.800 --> 02:53:49.560
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: Yes.

asr-004251
02:53:49.920 --> 02:53:55.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Patrick Gatan was appointed 2000, 2001, 2002

asr-004252
02:53:55.600 --> 02:53:59.660
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: to take a look at the West of Manggahan Flood Control Project.

asr-004253
02:54:00.520 --> 02:54:02.960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pasensya na, Sek, I'll be looking at this side

asr-004254
02:54:02.960 --> 02:54:05.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: kasi mas bata yung mga na this side.

asr-004255
02:54:05.600 --> 02:54:09.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I don't think they have the institutional and historic...

asr-004256
02:54:09.600 --> 02:54:14.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pasensya na po kayo sa side na to na natabihan nyo lang si Yusek Sadein.

asr-004257
02:54:15.000 --> 02:54:18.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sir, yung West of Manggahan Project,

asr-004258
02:54:18.800 --> 02:54:21.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: kay Sekretary Vigilar pa yun?

asr-004259
02:54:22.460 --> 02:54:24.060
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: It started from that period.

asr-004260
02:54:24.080 --> 02:54:30.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: To your knowledge, did PRA require a permit from the DPWH at that time?

asr-004261
02:54:32.540 --> 02:54:33.520
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: I think wala po siya.

asr-004262
02:54:33.520 --> 02:54:33.920
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay, okay.

asr-004263
02:54:35.300 --> 02:54:39.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: 2007 na tapos, 2007-2008 yung road dike

asr-004264
02:54:39.700 --> 02:54:45.100
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: dun sa package ng West of Manggahan from Bicutan all the way to Taytay.

asr-004265
02:54:46.420 --> 02:54:47.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: After that,

asr-004266
02:54:47.300 --> 02:54:49.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: dinagdagan pa yung road dike.

asr-004267
02:54:49.920 --> 02:54:53.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: During that time, do you remember if the PRA asked for a reclamation permit?

asr-004268
02:54:54.440 --> 02:54:55.120
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: Wala po siya.

asr-004269
02:54:55.200 --> 02:54:55.400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-004270
02:54:55.520 --> 02:54:57.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Because it's more of a flood control project.

asr-004271
02:54:57.240 --> 02:54:57.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No.

asr-004272
02:54:58.920 --> 02:55:03.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: If you look at the definition of the PRA LLDA,

asr-004273
02:55:04.920 --> 02:55:07.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: it covers road dikes and flood controls.

asr-004274
02:55:08.320 --> 02:55:09.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And they confirmed that.

asr-004275
02:55:10.080 --> 02:55:12.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, i-clear ang kulay ng Sekretary.

asr-004276
02:55:12.340 --> 02:55:14.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: This is what I meant to make the point.

asr-004277
02:55:15.840 --> 02:55:17.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: It is only in 2020,

asr-004278
02:55:17.300 --> 02:55:22.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: that the PRA wants you to get a permit.

asr-004279
02:55:23.560 --> 02:55:25.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And so, I will move to the legal.

asr-004280
02:55:26.540 --> 02:55:28.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, sir, ikaw na ba yung head ng legal?

asr-004281
02:55:31.180 --> 02:55:32.020
DPWH Undersecretary Samuel Rufino J. Turgano: Yes, Paolo, sir.

asr-004282
02:55:32.240 --> 02:55:39.120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Are you familiar with the 1995 DOJ opinion signed by former Vice President

asr-004283
02:55:39.120 --> 02:55:41.520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: and at that time DOJ Secretary, Gin Gona?

asr-004284
02:55:43.660 --> 02:55:45.200
DPWH Undersecretary Samuel Rufino J. Turgano: My apologies, Senator.

asr-004285
02:55:45.200 --> 02:55:45.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: It's okay.

asr-004286
02:55:45.780 --> 02:55:47.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But I will give you a copy.

asr-004287
02:55:47.300 --> 02:55:50.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I will give you a copy because I will tell this in front of the Secretary

asr-004288
02:55:50.240 --> 02:55:56.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: that I am offended that instead of your department answering the PRA

asr-004289
02:55:56.220 --> 02:55:58.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: na never kayo nag-require ng permit,

asr-004290
02:55:59.080 --> 02:56:01.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: nag-issue kayo ng cease of disease sa sarili nyo.

asr-004291
02:56:03.240 --> 02:56:09.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Because if you look at the 1995 DOJ opinion,

asr-004292
02:56:09.560 --> 02:56:16.040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: ang sabi dito, ang meron pong jurisdiction ay yung LLDA.

asr-004293
02:56:16.040 --> 02:56:16.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay.

asr-004294
02:56:17.300 --> 02:56:18.600
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: As special law.

asr-004295
02:56:19.500 --> 02:56:22.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But, eto, dito ka muna, sir.

asr-004296
02:56:22.920 --> 02:56:23.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Don't worry.

asr-004297
02:56:23.700 --> 02:56:26.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I will, I'm just expressing, masosolve to.

asr-004298
02:56:26.880 --> 02:56:30.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But, you, sir, I'll tell you something with your permission.

asr-004299
02:56:31.140 --> 02:56:35.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Assuming for the sake of argument, mag-aaway ang LLDA at PRA

asr-004300
02:56:35.560 --> 02:56:38.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: sa sino may jurisdiction sa reclamation,

asr-004301
02:56:40.360 --> 02:56:42.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: papayag ba ang DPWH na maipit kayo?

asr-004302
02:56:43.040 --> 02:56:46.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ikaw, as head of legal, mapapayag ka ba yung maipit kayo?

asr-004303
02:56:47.300 --> 02:56:48.800
DPWH Undersecretary Samuel Rufino J. Turgano: No, Mr. Senator, no.

asr-004304
02:56:48.800 --> 02:56:57.020
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, if for 40 years, ang batas ng PRA at LLDA is 1960s and 1970s.

asr-004305
02:56:57.540 --> 02:57:00.060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, kung more than 50 years, mas matanda pa sa akin,

asr-004306
02:57:01.800 --> 02:57:04.900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: LLDA ang sinusunod, biglang papasok ang PRA,

asr-004307
02:57:05.740 --> 02:57:08.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: tama ba yun na matitigil ang projects natin?

asr-004308
02:57:10.920 --> 02:57:13.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi ba dapat mag-usap muna yung dalawang departamento?

asr-004309
02:57:13.720 --> 02:57:15.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, I leave it at that, Secretary.

asr-004310
02:57:17.300 --> 02:57:20.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Assistant GM, literal, is supposed to be here

asr-004311
02:57:20.800 --> 02:57:24.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: because they committed that they will be here para mag-usap kayo.

asr-004312
02:57:25.740 --> 02:57:28.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: PRA always wants more jurisdiction.

asr-004313
02:57:29.720 --> 02:57:31.500
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But LLDA is a special law.

asr-004314
02:57:32.080 --> 02:57:33.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Tama ba ako, Yusek Sadein?

asr-004315
02:57:34.060 --> 02:57:37.920
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: You coordinated with the LLDA for the Laguna Lake Road Network.

asr-004316
02:57:37.920 --> 02:57:42.880
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: Yeah, actually, both LLDA and PRA have been part of the study

asr-004317
02:57:42.880 --> 02:57:44.920
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: when we had the feasibility studies.

asr-004318
02:57:44.920 --> 02:57:46.360
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: Pero tama po kayo.

asr-004319
02:57:46.480 --> 02:57:46.920
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: But the...

asr-004320
02:57:47.300 --> 02:57:49.960
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: The agreement was dictated by the LLDA.

asr-004321
02:57:50.640 --> 02:57:52.840
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: And PRA just come in just to check

asr-004322
02:57:52.840 --> 02:57:56.160
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: if there is such thing as reclamations on the alignment

asr-004323
02:57:56.160 --> 02:57:58.380
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: that we had generated from the past studies.

asr-004324
02:57:59.160 --> 02:58:02.520
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: So, that's why, sir, the LLDA,

asr-004325
02:58:02.720 --> 02:58:05.420
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: we had entered into memorandum of agreement

asr-004326
02:58:05.420 --> 02:58:07.740
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: as early as July 2024.

asr-004327
02:58:08.640 --> 02:58:12.160
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: And the coming weeks, we'll be entering also with PRA

asr-004328
02:58:12.160 --> 02:58:14.720
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: to monitor relative to our compliance

asr-004329
02:58:14.720 --> 02:58:17.180
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: if there is a reclamation, violations,

asr-004330
02:58:17.300 --> 02:58:18.000
DPWH Senior Undersecretary Emil K. Sadain: or none at all.

asr-004331
02:58:19.160 --> 02:58:19.640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes.

asr-004332
02:58:19.960 --> 02:58:21.900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And again, if you look at all the definitions,

asr-004333
02:58:22.300 --> 02:58:23.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: it's considered a reclamation.

asr-004334
02:58:24.280 --> 02:58:26.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, wala na tayong pag-uusapan doon.

asr-004335
02:58:27.180 --> 02:58:30.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang hindi lang nila kinoconsidered reclamation yung stilts.

asr-004336
02:58:30.800 --> 02:58:33.400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But anything na tubig or foreshore,

asr-004337
02:58:34.160 --> 02:58:36.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: foreshore meaning between high and low tide,

asr-004338
02:58:36.140 --> 02:58:37.440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: pero iba ang Laguna Lake eh.

asr-004339
02:58:37.940 --> 02:58:39.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi hindi masyadong tidal yan.

asr-004340
02:58:39.800 --> 02:58:41.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi lake hindi yan dagat.

asr-004341
02:58:42.120 --> 02:58:43.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, which goes to my next point.

asr-004342
02:58:43.660 --> 02:58:46.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And I don't know kung sino may institutional memory dito.

asr-004343
02:58:47.300 --> 02:58:50.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, meron pa ba natira dito na nandun pa si Secretary Villar?

asr-004344
02:58:50.880 --> 02:58:51.140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Wala na.

asr-004345
02:58:52.380 --> 02:58:53.220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Wala na, no?

asr-004346
02:58:53.620 --> 02:58:55.340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi, I don't know if you're familiar,

asr-004347
02:58:55.540 --> 02:58:56.700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Usec, Usec,

asr-004348
02:58:56.800 --> 02:58:58.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: second last, no?

asr-004349
02:58:59.120 --> 02:59:00.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I don't know if you know this.

asr-004350
02:59:00.460 --> 02:59:03.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: There were three alignments for the west of Mangahan

asr-004351
02:59:03.560 --> 02:59:05.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: road dike in Taguig.

asr-004352
02:59:06.400 --> 02:59:06.840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay?

asr-004353
02:59:07.280 --> 02:59:09.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay, the first alignment was inland.

asr-004354
02:59:10.140 --> 02:59:12.260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: The second alignment is the present alignment.

asr-004355
02:59:12.880 --> 02:59:14.980
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: The third alignment was in the Laguna Lake.

asr-004356
02:59:14.980 --> 02:59:16.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: What's the difference?

asr-004357
02:59:16.380 --> 02:59:21.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: The second alignment had 1,300 hectares outside the lake.

asr-004358
02:59:22.440 --> 02:59:25.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: This is actual land, not foreshore land.

asr-004359
02:59:26.320 --> 02:59:29.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: That's why nagdidebate kami ni Secretary Villar

asr-004360
02:59:29.000 --> 02:59:30.380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: when I was a young congressman

asr-004361
02:59:30.380 --> 02:59:34.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: because ganyang kakapal yung papel niya from the JICA.

asr-004362
02:59:34.720 --> 02:59:37.860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang akin isang papel lang computing the real property tax

asr-004363
02:59:37.860 --> 02:59:40.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: to be generated by 1,300 hectares

asr-004364
02:59:40.420 --> 02:59:42.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: that would pay for the additional 5 billion

asr-004365
02:59:42.940 --> 02:59:44.400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: if we move the alignment

asr-004366
02:59:44.400 --> 02:59:46.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: towards the lake.

asr-004367
02:59:46.380 --> 02:59:47.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, it's the water.

asr-004368
02:59:47.620 --> 02:59:49.300
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But remember, during that time,

asr-004369
02:59:50.520 --> 02:59:52.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: napakaliit ng budget ng DPDL wage.

asr-004370
02:59:52.860 --> 02:59:55.240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, napakalaki ng 5 billion.

asr-004371
02:59:55.720 --> 02:59:56.680
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, what's my point?

asr-004372
02:59:58.360 --> 03:00:00.040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pagka yung lupa ay hindi...

asr-004373
03:00:00.000 --> 03:00:10.540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: For sure, hindi reclamation yun pag nilagyan mo ng lupa. May permit pa rin yun pero hindi sa PRA.

asr-004374
03:00:10.540 --> 03:00:20.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. So my point, Secretary, I'll go to the next point. Do you remember gano'ng kataas yung elevation ng Laguna Lake?

asr-004375
03:00:23.760 --> 03:00:26.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sa inyo ba, sa LLRN, anong elevation niya?

asr-004376
03:00:26.480 --> 03:00:36.340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: We are considering po yung 12.5 meters na average annual maximum lake level.

asr-004377
03:00:36.340 --> 03:00:49.340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pakitignan mo ulit ha. Kasi yung sa road dike is 15 and they said that that 15 will be like 100 years or more given yung siltation at saka yung tubig.

asr-004378
03:00:50.560 --> 03:00:56.340
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But nung nangyari yung undoy, I was telling SecVins, kilala niya yung isang may weather station tapos pumunta.

asr-004379
03:00:56.480 --> 03:01:01.800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Parang two feet na lang going to the Pasig River, aabutin na.

asr-004380
03:01:03.040 --> 03:01:13.880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So if you look at the, if you just do a Google check, at one point in time, the DPWH decided to add one meter sa road dike.

asr-004381
03:01:14.880 --> 03:01:26.160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: That's why if you look at the two other lanes na ginawa ni SecMark, compared sa ginawa nila SecSingson at ginawa ng panahon ni President GMA, mas mataas.

asr-004382
03:01:26.480 --> 03:01:35.360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And if you look at the park beside, so eto lang, sa media kasi ang napapakita parang ganyan, diba?

asr-004383
03:01:35.920 --> 03:01:44.320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Can we show the short video? I want to show people and with your permission SecVins, kung ano talaga ang itsura nung...

asr-004384
03:01:56.480 --> 03:02:19.940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I think you get the point. But my point is this.

asr-004385
03:02:21.280 --> 03:02:23.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ano ang purpose ng linear park?

asr-004386
03:02:24.560 --> 03:02:26.080
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So tinanong ko rin ito sa PRA.

asr-004387
03:02:26.080 --> 03:02:32.180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sabi ko sa PRA, Sir, kapag ka hindi nyo inayos yung gilid ng road, ano mangyayari?

asr-004388
03:02:32.420 --> 03:02:35.620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sagot nila mag-e-road. Masisira din. So kailangan.

asr-004389
03:02:35.960 --> 03:02:39.420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pag inayos mo, tapos kalye yun, anong mangyayari sa lake?

asr-004390
03:02:40.040 --> 03:02:46.260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sir, magtatapon lang ng basura yung tao. Or dunji jingle. Or worse, babahayan to.

asr-004391
03:02:46.980 --> 03:02:52.560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So that's my question. Is the DPWH, is someone here still familiar with lupang-aryanda?

asr-004392
03:02:56.080 --> 03:03:03.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay, if you didn't hear it, paglampas mo ng Pasig River, may claim pa rin dun ang Taytay, Pasig at Taguig.

asr-004393
03:03:05.860 --> 03:03:16.280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: They put stilts, houses, then underneath the stilt which is Lampas Tao, they'll burn basura and say it's filling material.

asr-004394
03:03:16.280 --> 03:03:21.720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And when I went there as a young congressman, ang layo na nilakad ko, hindi ko makita.

asr-004395
03:03:22.280 --> 03:03:25.920
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: When I finally got to that house, swampy, lampas tuhod ko yung...

asr-004396
03:03:25.920 --> 03:03:31.660
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: lumusong ako sa tubig, nasa taas ko yung floor ng bahay.

asr-004397
03:03:32.300 --> 03:03:37.480
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Tapos sabi ko, ito ba? Sabi, Sir, yung nilakad mo for the last 10 minutes, yun na yung na-fill na.

asr-004398
03:03:39.000 --> 03:03:42.400
