asr-004744
03:22:28.140 --> 03:22:32.440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: But they usually go about 1%.

asr-004745
03:22:32.440 --> 03:22:36.780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So kung 1 billion yung project, magkano 1% nun?

asr-004746
