asr-004747
03:22:40.220 --> 03:22:42.000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: 100, 150,000 ang sweldo.

asr-004748
03:22:43.360 --> 03:22:48.260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: And at any point in time, he'll have 10 applications for buildings.

asr-004749
03:22:48.960 --> 03:22:51.780
